~ start
Master Baker Receptionist: Wow! You can really decorate like no other!
Master Baker Receptionist: You've performed well enough to pass the first stage, but don't forget, the stages will progress in difficulty as you move further.
Master Baker Receptionist: Not only that, but you'll be facing more experienced bakers with each progressive stage.
Master Baker Receptionist: If you wanna become a true Master Baker, you'll have to beat the best of the best.
Master Baker Receptionist: Now, you'll be moved to the next stage. Unfortunately, I am only qualified to oversee the first stage of the competition.
Master Baker Receptionist: Allow me to introduce your new guide for the Master Baker Competition.
Master Baker Branch Manager: Great tidings ambitious bakers! I am your Branch Manager. I'll shall guide you through the second stage of the competition.
Master Baker Branch Manager: For the second stage, we will be increasing the time restriction.
Master Baker Branch Manager: In other words, you will need to be able to decorate your cake within a shorter span of time.
Master Baker Branch Manager: As stated by my predecessor, you will be rewarded based not only on speed or precision, but on the spin of the cake.
Master Baker Branch Manager: As the original Master Baker once said,...
Master Baker Branch Manager: "The mark of one's baking mastery is dependent also upon the spin of their cake."
Master Baker Branch Manager: Thank you for your hard work, second stage candidates, and may the power of baking be with you.
=> END